Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:12.37,0:00:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,服饰公司 喵可鲁\N营业三课办公室
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:15.97,0:00:19.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波多野  过来下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:20.78,0:00:23.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.69,0:00:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失礼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:43.00,0:00:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:51.11,0:00:53.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今年刚进来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:53.81,0:00:57.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是公司一直没起色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:59.21,0:01:02.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.92,0:01:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:06.72,0:01:08.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.82,0:01:12.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:13.33,0:01:17.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你非常优秀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.73,0:01:22.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:22.34,0:01:25.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只靠你一个人人努力\N身材超好的结衣被性骚扰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.64,0:01:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没办法\N丝袜公司员工
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:30.75,0:01:33.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢夸赞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:34.35,0:01:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你非常优秀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:38.85,0:01:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又努力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:45.16,0:01:49.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有事要拜托你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.07,0:01:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你答应
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.47,0:01:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,课长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:00.48,0:02:02.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请抬起头
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.18,0:02:06.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会努力的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.78,0:02:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,课长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.29,0:02:14.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.79,0:02:18.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,课长  别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.49,0:02:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会努力的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.50,0:02:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:31.11,0:02:33.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔天下班后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.11,0:02:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.01,0:02:41.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兴奋吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.33,0:02:53.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.33,0:03:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爽吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.54,0:03:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:03.24,0:03:07.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:31.77,0:03:35.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.01,0:04:19.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:53.75,0:04:56.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.85,0:05:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.36,0:05:07.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.86,0:05:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.27,0:05:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被发现说不定会丢工作唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:21.08,0:05:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换地方吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:01.92,0:06:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好唷  我也想做爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:13.81,0:09:18.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好想要肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.98,0:10:25.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好爽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:39.09,0:10:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:03.78,0:12:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想大家都知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.98,0:12:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.09,0:12:13.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公司的成绩非常差
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.59,0:12:17.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只靠波多野一个人撑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:20.30,0:12:22.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:23.90,0:12:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望大家也努力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.90,0:12:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你这么说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.11,0:12:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有什么好方法吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.72,0:12:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开发新商品吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:47.02,0:12:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然会这么做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.12,0:12:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的方法呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.33,0:12:56.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,办个商品秀呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.44,0:13:04.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:04.74,0:13:09.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们丝袜部门大多是男性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.15,0:13:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以需要女性穿上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:18.55,0:13:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样  波多野
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.86,0:13:29.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方签约的话  业绩也增加了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.67,0:13:40.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请穿上然后展示吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:48.58,0:13:53.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:29.54,0:16:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波多野  请说明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.55,0:16:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.65,0:16:41.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个商品  等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:41.86,0:16:44.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部都要讲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.86,0:16:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把裙子拉起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.27,0:16:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  抱歉唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.57,0:16:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.37,0:17:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来  还要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:03.78,0:17:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:07.98,0:17:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.29,0:17:18.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我继续了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.49,0:17:20.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个商品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.60,0:17:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们的新商品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:24.80,0:17:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比以往的商品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.30,0:17:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要加透气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.11,0:17:41.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为是用新材质做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:42.82,0:17:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以触感
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.42,0:17:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:50.33,0:17:53.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会摩擦到裙子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:56.33,0:18:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腰部的设计呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:00.54,0:18:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腰部？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.74,0:18:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:10.75,0:18:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腰部的设计
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:14.95,0:18:17.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算穿迷你裙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:17.35,0:18:20.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会有问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.06,0:18:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屁股的部分呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:30.27,0:18:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个部分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:33.57,0:18:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:37.77,0:18:41.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算一直摩擦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.98,0:18:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会破
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:52.79,0:18:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.11,0:19:21.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那另一个呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:21.92,0:19:23.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:30.63,0:19:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边的商品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:35.13,0:19:39.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是裤袜类型
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.24,0:19:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就想这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.74,0:19:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有特别设计
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:50.45,0:19:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:57.95,0:20:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿起来感觉怎样？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:02.16,0:20:05.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很温柔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.26,0:20:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:10.57,0:20:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那腰的部分呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:14.47,0:20:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腰吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:17.77,0:20:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:32.79,0:20:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转过去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.29,0:20:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屁股的部分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:41.20,0:20:44.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有比较薄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:45.10,0:20:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不会起毛球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.31,0:21:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:01.62,0:21:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个还是需要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:04.92,0:21:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们亲自试试
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:07.32,0:21:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲自试
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:15.73,0:21:18.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:19.03,0:21:23.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:23.84,0:21:28.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好摸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:32.55,0:21:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:37.35,0:21:41.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:43.06,0:21:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是公司的商品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:47.26,0:21:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:17.89,0:22:22.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:22.70,0:22:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:26.60,0:22:30.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我摸看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:43.42,0:22:47.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,触感很好呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:53.03,0:22:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:02.64,0:23:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换后面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:09.84,0:23:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:25.70,0:27:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:30.51,0:27:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:16.45,0:28:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几天后 到代理店社长的家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:21.86,0:28:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请进      失礼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:23.66,0:28:27.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:31.77,0:28:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你假日还听我说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:35.07,0:28:37.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:37.17,0:28:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的话我很欢迎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:41.38,0:28:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:44.08,0:28:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以请你帮忙吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:48.58,0:28:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来很多次了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:51.29,0:28:55.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,签约是没问题啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:55.49,0:28:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:57.89,0:28:59.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:59.39,0:29:03.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是一直单纯的卖商品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:03.90,0:29:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我更了解商品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:08.10,0:29:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定可以卖更好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:11.41,0:29:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:14.41,0:29:17.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常棒的想法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:18.31,0:29:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我又穿不了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:23.42,0:29:27.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你穿上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:27.32,0:29:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再让我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:33.03,0:29:36.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我穿？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:36.93,0:29:41.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我每个月都买15趴的商品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:41.74,0:29:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:49.54,0:29:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:56.15,0:29:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:58.85,0:30:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是新商品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:02.16,0:30:04.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用了新材质
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:04.56,0:30:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常柔软
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:08.46,0:30:13.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来啊  非常美呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:14.47,0:30:18.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为穿的人美吧  没有啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:19.57,0:30:24.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你转过去    好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:27.08,0:30:31.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往前倾一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:31.29,0:30:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样？  对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:37.29,0:30:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确非常美呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:42.70,0:30:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常好呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:51.41,0:30:54.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:54.71,0:30:56.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以脱掉吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:56.51,0:30:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社长  那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:59.81,0:31:04.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  别乱动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:04.62,0:31:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样看的比较清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:09.72,0:31:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:11.83,0:31:15.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用害羞
